Package: scandolaR
Type: Package
Title: Utility Functions for Statistical Analysis and Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Michele",
        family = "Scandola",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "michele.scandola@proton.me"
    )
Description: A collection of utility functions for statistical analysis,
    regression modelling, mixed-effects models, data inspection, outlier
    detection, effect-size conversion, variable transformation, and graphical
    diagnostics. The package includes functions for assessing collinearity in
    mixed-effects models, extracting legends from 'ggplot2' objects, visually
    inspecting observations, and identifying outliers according to several
    commonly used criteria.
